pub const NOTE : str = "No safe probe has been sent: the 2026-09-09 probe pass predates this registration, which is why the manifest row carries no deployment reading. The live status endpoint answered on 2026-09-22 with 2 runs over seven days and none failed. RETRIES is 0 on purpose: a retry after a partial send would deliver the owner the same report twice. 07:00 UTC is 10:00 in Moscow, which keeps no summer time. A read of the events table that fails is logged and does not become an empty report.";
